*** Settings ***
Documentation     [SUITE PURPOSE]
...    This suite tests the scenario of configuring PUCCH Format 3 (PF3) resources in the FDD PCell to carry
...    UCI data for each configured SCell. It assumes FDD PCell + 2 TDD SCell. The test is performed on a 5G Classical
...    SA CMWV L1Bypass cloud test line with a SANSA FS CPRI CMWV FDD+ECPRI CMWV TDD AZQJ variant.
...    It uses a configurationwith 6 cells, 3CC CA and 4 UEs.

Force Tags    CDRT    CONFIGURED    CRT    PY39    RAN_5G    RAN_5G_TDD    SBTS00
    ...    CLOUD_5G_I_LO_AP_LO
    ...    VARIANT_SANSA_FS_CPRI_CMWV_FDD+ECPRI_CMWV_TDD_AZQJ

Resource      resources/5GC002640_resources.robot

Suite Setup    Run keywords    Prepare suite environment  egate_config=${lua_cfg_file}  rad_params=@{SWCONFIG_FLAGS_LIST}
...                            ap_xml=${ap_xml}  scfc=${scfc}
...            AND  Activate Beamforming on Cell 3
...            AND  Activate Beamforming on Cell 6
...            AND  Activate Beam Refinement on Cell 3
...            AND  Activate Beam Refinement on Cell 6
...            AND  Create aliases
...            AND  Setup eNB Fsm Access  alias=gNB2
Suite Teardown  Clean suite environment

*** Variables ***
${lua_cfg_file}=  ${CFG_DIR}/egate_config_FDD_TDD_6Cells_SANSA_3CC_CA_4UEs.cfg
${ap_xml}=        ${CFG_DIR}/GNB_LO_AP_LO_FDD_TDD_2AEQE_6Cells_FS_SANSA_3CC_CA/iphy_AHLOA_AHCA_AHFIB_AEQE_AEQE_6Cells-8.xml
${scfc}=          ${CFG_DIR}/GNB_LO_AP_LO_FDD_TDD_2AEQE_6Cells_FS_SANSA_3CC_CA/SCFC_FDD_TDD_6Cells_L1B_SANSA_3CC_CA_FTT_BF_OFF-8.xml

*** Test Cases ***
5GC002640-AA-B4Ab8_Single_UE_Call-2_TDD_SCells_with_selective_Beamforming_enabling_and_selective_Beam_Refinement_activation-BF_on_both_BR_on_both
    [Documentation]
    ...     1.Description:
    ...         This user scenario describes the configuration of PUCCH Format 3 (PF3) resources in the FDD PCell
    ...         to carry UCI data for each configured SCell.
    ...         This user scenario assumes FDD PCell + 2 TDD SCell.
    ...         Note this User Scenario is not end to end but provides more details related to pCSI configuration
    ...         in the context of Single UE Call and SCell Addition.
    ...
    ...     2.Test Environment and Settings:
    ...         This item is testing in UTE environment:
    ...         * 5G Classical SA CMWV L1Bypass cloud test line (CLOUD_5G_I_BOO_AP_KLLL_SANSA_L1B_ECPRI_CMWV_TDD)
    ...         * gNB (ASIB, 2xABIO, AMIA), UE simulator (Airphone ASIK + 3xABIL), WTS 5G core simulator (Egate)
    ...         * gNB has configured 3CC for Carrier Aggregation: 1 Cell FDD and 2 Cells TDD (CA relations created)
    ...         * simulated Radio (AHLOA, AEQE, AEQE)
    ...
    ...     2.1 Testing Tools:
    ...         gNB - Nokia 5G BTS
    ...         Airphone (AP) - UEs simulator
    ...         WTS - ePC simulator - 5G core network simulator
    ...         Tcpdump & Wireshark - tools for capturing messages
    ...         BTSLog (cli) for collecting gNB & AP remote syslog
    ...         Robot Framework and Python runtime environment to automate the testing process
    ...         Web Element Manager
    ...
    ...     2.2 Test Automation
    ...         Robot Framework
    ...
    ...    3. Definitions from the test set
    ...    Test case covers: 5G_RAN_USR _RRM_4537
    ...
    ...    3.1 Definitions from the Test Plan
    ...         PCell - Primary Cell
    ...         SCell - Secondary Cell
    ...
    ...    3.2 Required Logs
    ...         Wireshark/TCPdump Logs (NGAP, NR-RRC, E1AP, F1AP)
    ...         TTI Trace
    ...         Counters
    ...         Default gNB & AP SysLog
    ...         BTS Snapshot
    ...         BIP logs
    ...         Sherpa Trace
    ...         AP sosReport
    ...
    ...     4.Testing instructions
    ...
    ...     4.1 Preconditions:
    ...         gNB configuration is given in US 5GC002640-AA#B1 Feature activation of 3CC DL CA
    ...
    ...         gNB configuration:
    ...         -  New L2RT architecture (CB007736) is enabled:
    ...         			NRBTS/NRDU.flexibleCAMode = 2 (ConfigurationIndependent)
    ...         -  Mobility support for mixed carrier aggregation (CB008015) is enabled:
    ...         		NRBTS/NRDU.actConnectedModeMobilityCA = True
    ...         -  All FDD cells are configured to allow SA access:
    ...         		MRBTS/NRBTS.gNbCuType = SA+NSA
    ...         		Each FDD Cell has configured MRBTS/NRBTS/NRCELL.cellDepType = SA
    ...         -  Inter-band FDD + TDD FR1 DL CA feature (5GC002640) is activated and legacy CA features are activated too:
    ...         		NRBTS/NRDU.carrierAggregationSupportList contains elements equal to value 600 (ca_Fdd_Any_Sa),
    ...                 200 (ca_Fdd_Fr1Tdd_Sa) and 3 (ca_Fdd_Fdd)
    ...         -  CA relations are configured for each FDD cell by NRRELs pointing to:
    ...         		2 TDD FR1 Cells: Cell-3 and Cell-6
    ...         -  SCell Addition method is set to blind:
    ...         		each NRREL object NRBTS/NRCELL/NRREL.SCellAdditionMethod parameter is set to 0 (blind)
    ...         -  SCell activation method is set to blind:
    ...         		NRBTS.SCellActivationMethod = 0 (blind)
    ...         -  5GC002255 is activated:
    ...         		NRBTS/NRDU.actInterNumerologyCa = True
    ...         -  DRX is disabled in both FDD and TDD FR1 Cells:
    ...         		NRBTS/NRCELL.actCDrx = False
    ...         -  DSS features are disabled in FDD Cells:
    ...         		NRBTS.actLteNrDss = False
    ...         -  Aperiodic CSI is disabled in all Cells:
    ...         		NRBTS/NRCELL.actAperCsi = False
    ...         -  TDD Cells are configured with subframe configuration according to 5GC001116-B (TD LTE config 2 SSF6 starting from SFN 0):
    ...         		frameStructureType = tdLte
    ...         		guardPeriodLength = 6 symbols (SSF6)
    ...         		lteToNrFrameShift = 0ms
    ...         		prachConfiguration = 97 (format A2 in subframe 7)
    ...         		ssBurstSetPeriod = 20ms
    ...         -  TDD Cells are configured without beamforming:
    ...         		NRBTS/NRCELL.actBeamforming = False
    ...         		NRBTS/NRCELL.pucchF3MaxCodeRate = 0.08
    ...         		NRBTS/NRCELL.pucchF3ModulationScheme = pi2BPSK
    ...         -  TDD Cells are configured without 5GC002200:
    ...         		NRBTS/NRCELL.dlMimoMode <> 70 (8x4 Closed Loop Spatial Multiplexing)
    ...         -  Long PUCCH is enabled:
    ...         		NRBTS/NRCELL.pucchModeSelect = longPucch
    ...         -  FDM scheduling is enabled:
    ...         		NRBTS.actFdmScheduling = True
    ...         		NRBTS/NRCELL.actIncreasedFdmUsersPerSlot = True
    ...         -  FDD and TDD Cells are configured and On-Air, FDD Cell-1 and 2 TDD Cells are active,
    ...         -  NR-UE1 supports FDD-TDD 3CC CA with band combinations:
    ...         		CA_n41A-n66A-n71A (FDD n71+ FDD n66 + TDD n41),
    ...         		CA_n41(2A)-n71A (FDD n71 + TDD n41 + TDD n41),
    ...         		CA_n41C-n71A (FDD n71 + TDD n41 + TDD n41),
    ...         		CA_n41A-n71A-n77A (FDD n71+ TDD n41 + TDD n77)
    ...
    ...		    During ICS, a format 3 PUCCH resource from Set1 was configured for pCSI reporting of the PCell
    ...         or multiplexed pCSI & HARQ AN reporting.
    ...
    ...     4.2 Test steps:
    ...    Description:
    ...    a)	Activation of beamforming on SCell-1 and SCell-2 with BeamRefinement set to on for SCell-1 and SCell-2:
    ...    SCell-1 and SCell-2:
    ...      o	NRBTS/NRCELL.actBeamforming = True
    ...      o	NRBTS/NRCELL.nrBtsBeamRefinementP2 = True
    ...      o  NRBTS/NRCELL.pucchF3MaxCodeRate = 0.15
    ...    b)	3CC capable NR-UE1 is registered to PCell ( Cell-1 )
    ...    c)	PDU session is setup for NR-UE1 to trigger SCell Addition.
    ...    d)	Verification of F1AP messaging and RRC Reconfiguration procedure.
    ...    e)	250mbps DL UDP  traffic is started ( not full buffer )
    ...    f)	Collect TTITrace and verify pCSI and beam reports.
    ...    g)	Verification of traffic – shouldn`t be degraded.
    ...    h)	Release of PDU Session and deregistration of NR-UE1.
    ...    Expected:
    ...    a)	Verification of F1AP messaging and RRC Reconfiguration procedure:
    ...      a.	Cell 3 and Cell 6 are in the SCell-ToBeSetupMod-List within F1AP: UE CONTEXT MODIFICATION REQUEST
    ...      b.	Selected band combination in F1AP: UE CONTEXT MODIFICATION is CA_n41A-n71A-n77A
    ...      c.	F1AP: UE CONTEXT MODIFICATION REQUEST is sent
    ...      d.	F1AP: UE CONTEXT MODIFICATION RESPONSE is sent and contains CSI-RS, PUCCH pCSI, HARQ ACK/NACK reporting configuration,
    ...         MaxMIMO-Layers configuration for each CCC, SelectedBandCombinationIndex and SelectedFeatureSetEntryIndex
    ...      e.	RRCReconfiguration is sent in F1AP: DL RRC MESSAGE TRANSFER
    ...      f.	RRCReconfigurationComplete is sent in F1AP: UL RRC MESSAGE TRANSFER
    ...    b) Verification of pCSI and beam reports:
    ...     a.	Two additional PF3 resources are configured for HARQ AN in resource set1.
    ...     b.	On TDD SCells one resource for CSI report of Channel acquisition is added.
    ...     c.	An additional PF3 resource from Set2 is allocated at SCell Addition for Beam Management reports with beam refinement reports
    ...     d.	Beam reports with beam refinement reports are sent for both SCells.
    ...
    ...
    ...	   5. References
    ...         [1] CFAM for 5GC002640 - [LINK]
