    ...         v0.1 2021.07.22 Marcin Gorczyca - test case draft
    ...         v0.2 2021.08.30 Marcin Gorczyca - first IODT update
    ...         v0.3 2021.09.10 Marcin Gorczyca - Adjustment to new template, second IODT update.
    ...         v0.4 2021.10.15 Marcin Gorczyca - Test plan corrected to address comments from the review.
    ...         v0.5 2021.11.05 Marcin Gorczyca - IODT tests removed, minor errors corrected.
    ...         v0.5 2021.11.08 Marcin Gorczyca - Review completed
    ...         v0.6 2024.02.21 Magdalena Hebda - Remove unused RH (AHFIB, AHCA) due to configuraton errors on AP


    Change NR-UE1 3CC CA capabilities to support band combination CA_n41A-n71A-n77A, CA_n41A-n66A-n71A, CA_n41(2A)-n71A, CA_n41C-n71A
    Register 3CC CA capable NR-UE1 to gNB-2 Cell-1
    Establish PDU session for NR-UE1 to trigger successful 3CC CA

    Verify SCell-ToBeSetupMod-List IE whether both TDD Cells were selected to 3CC CA for NR-UE1
    Verify allowedBC-ListMRDC IE whether CA_n71A-n41A-n77A band combination was selected to 3CC CA for NR-UE1
    Verify sCellToAddModList IE whether both TDD Cells were added as SCells for NR-UE1
    Verify iE-Extensions IE whether Selected Band Combination and Feature Set Entry Indexes were correct for FTT 3CC CA NR-UE1
    Verify spCellConfig and sCellToAddModList IEs whether maxMIMO-Layers DL and UL configuration was correct for NR-UE1

    Verify whether pCSI and HARQ AN and CRI of the best CSI-RS reporting configuration was sent for both TDD SCells for FTT 3CC CA NR-UE1
    Verify resourceSetToAddModList IE whether PUCCH resources were allocated correctly for BF enabled on both SCells for FTT 3CC CA NR-UE1

    Start SA traffic  ue=1  dir=dl  traffic_rate=250Mbps
    Wait 10s for throughput stable
    Collect TTI Traces during 5 seconds and save to directory 5GC002640_B4Ab3_Step4
    Verify if csi rs is present after scell activation   expected_csi_rs_config=4.0   cell_id=55
    Verify if csi rs is present after scell activation   expected_csi_rs_config=4.0   cell_id=52
    Verify csi reports dtx ratio	phys_cells_ids=50,52,55		accepted_ratio=50
    Verify if Ue performs csi measurement reports on all carriers  phys_cells_ids=50,52,55
    Verify If Csi Measurement Reports Are Done Via Dedicated Pucch Format3  pcell=50  scells=52,55

    verify that beam reports with beam refinement are sent for cell    cell_id=55
    verify that beam reports with beam refinement are sent for cell    cell_id=52

    [Teardown]  Run keywords  Produce Scout Data    AND
    ...                       Deregister NR-UE1
